  "note": "outputVoltsPerFS = 1.5 x the 342.6 V peak measured at the speaker with the Lead channel dimed (gain = volume = master = 1) on the 11 s calibrated DI (work/circuit-proofs/00_di_input_cal.wav, unit path at 192 kHz; 67.0 V rms). Catalogue defaults on the same DI: -13.3 dBFS peak, 0.059 FS rms (Lead). The Clean channel at its defaults reads -44 dBFS peak (a low-gain channel; see the notes)."
 },
